\newlabel{fig:profiles}{{4}{6}{Isoperimetric profiles. The empirical profile $b(k)$ (solid) dips well below the bisection width (dotted) at off-center sizes; the certified star marks the 141-tensor sycamore\_m20 subset with boundary exactly 40. The spectral bound (dashed) is certified but loose. This dip is what caps all profile-based bounds (Observation~\ref {obs:cap})}{figure.4}{}}
